ains in the initial Qualification stage with a deal value of $188,500 USD, centered on the Student Administration Suite product.</b></li><li><b>Primary contact Amanda Chen from Oracle Corporation continues to be engaged, reflecting stable stakeholder involvement and consistent communication.</b></li><li><b>The sales approach adheres to the Standard Sales Process, maintaining a moderate win probability of 34%, indicating cautious but steady interest.</b></li><li><b>Recent activity shows ongoing engagement without advancement in sales stage or probability, suggesting measured progress without significant acceleration or setbacks.</b></li><li><b>No expansion of the buying group or new engagement activities have been recorded, pointing to a focused but limited stakeholder base at this time.</b></li><li><b>The opportunity status remains open and active, with no indications of objections, delays, or negative developments, preserving a neutral momentum.</b></li></ul>\",\n              \"additionalInsightData\": \"{\\\"salesPlays\\\":{\\\"all\\\":\\\"300100651592251\\\",\\\"lastUpdated\\\":\\\"2026-04-17T07:40:00.710Z\\\"},\\\"recommendedContacts\\\":[]}\",\n              \"$id\": \"ENGMTINSIGHT_300100659363761\",\n              \"salesPlay\": null\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n,\n   \"insightNumber\": \"ENGMTINSIGHT_300100671331503\",\n  \"insightId\": 300100671331503,\n  \"objectPuid\": \"CDRM_131502\",\n  \"objectId\": 300100572529980,\n  \"objectCode\": \"Opportunity\"\n}"
